- vp run check:changed HEAD (14 files): format, lint, knip 1/2 and 2/2, typecheck of 2 packages, tests (9 files, 215 passed plus the cross-file run) and the React compiler check passed.
- node scripts/i18n-check.ts reports only drift that predates this commit; nothing about the new key.
- No run in a real client yet.

